WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Stand tall, bend the knees slightly, and sink into a soft chair position.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Cross the right thigh over the left; hook the right foot behind the calf if it's available.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Cross the left arm under the right, then wrap the forearms and press the palms.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Lift the elbows to shoulder height and reach the fingertips up.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Squeeze everything toward the midline, hold, then unwind and switch sides.
